<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pioneer Valley Tennis Matchmaker</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans">
  <nav class="bg-blue-600 text-white p-4 shadow-md">
    <span class="text-xl font-bold">PV Tennis</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="bg-blue-100 text-center py-16 px-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 text-blue-900">Pioneer Valley Tennis Matchmaker</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-8">Find local hitting partners at your skill level and with a schedule that works for you.</p>
    <a href="/profiles" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition">Find a Partner</a>
  </section>

  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Make a Profile</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Add your age, how long you've played, when you're free, and your USTA rating or ranking if you have one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Search for Players</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Look up players by name, filter by an exact USTA rating, or set a max ranking to find people at your level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Get on the Court</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Reach out to players whose availability matches yours and set up a time to hit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-gray-800 text-white p-8 rounded-lg text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Who It's For</h2>
      <p>Recreational players, junior athletes, and campus clubs around Amherst and the Pioneer Valley. You don't need a USTA rating to sign up.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="text-center text-gray-500 py-6 mt-8 border-t">
    <p>CS326 Group Project - William Bae, Edelson Garcia, Alexandria Anderson</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>